00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:45.920
So if it helps you with
connecting with people

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:49.595
or finding each other, we'll
share that in the chat as well.

00:01:49.595 --> 00:01:52.920
But thank you so much,
Yu, for joining us today.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:55.730
