00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:43.310
But before we reached--
before we go into that topic,

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:46.130
I can talk a little
bit about myself.

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:48.110
My background is biology.

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:50.630
Actually, I have my
undergraduate degree

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:51.870
in biotechnology.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.900
And I have my masters
