00:25:26.520 --> 00:25:31.890
And I'm wondering if you have
any recommendations for where

00:25:31.890 --> 00:25:34.090
to start [LAUGHS] with that?

00:25:34.090 --> 00:25:36.600
I think there are so many
different things for people

00:25:36.600 --> 00:25:40.260
