00:25:47.700 --> 00:25:50.640
If you mean you want
to build a data science

00:25:50.640 --> 00:25:54.000
team from scratch, I
would say that first you

00:25:54.000 --> 00:25:58.860
figure out what your team
can do for the business.

00:25:58.860 --> 00:26:01.290
It's not if data
science can have

00:26:01.290 --> 00:26:02.840
little to do for
the business and can

00:26:02.840 --> 00:26:05.298
