that it doesn't make sense

00:26:05.298 --> 00:26:06.660
for you to build a team there.

00:26:06.660 --> 00:26:09.570
You need to go to a
new company probably.

00:26:09.570 --> 00:26:14.070
And if there is a need,
so if you're figuring out,

00:26:14.070 --> 00:26:16.350
for data science can
create this value,

00:26:16.350 --> 00:26:18.090
this value, this value
for the business,

00:26:18.090 --> 00:26:21.540
then first you need
to, I would say,

00:26:21.540 --> 00:26:23.580
do some public
relations component.

00:26:23.580 --> 00:26:26.730
You need to let everybody, all
the leaders in the company,

00:26:26.730 --> 00:26:27.870
understand this.

00:26:27.870 --> 00:26:32.660
So usually, for example,
for my EMBA education,

00:26:32.660 --> 00:26:35.610
they usually ask
you to do feedback.

00:26:35.610 --> 00:26:38.080
So they ask you to reach
out to the leaders,

00:26:38.080 --> 00:26:40.170
your coworkers in the company.

00:26:40.170 --> 00:26:43.860
And you ask them to provide
feedback for yourself

00:26:43.860 --> 00:26:47.500
and then probably
you also can say,

00:26:47.500 --> 00:26:49.410
my goal is to build
a data science team.

00:26:49.410 --> 00:26:51.840
My goal is to become a data
science leader in this company

00:26:51.840 --> 00:26:52.840
in the next year.

00:26:52.840 --> 00:26:55.700
So what I need to do?

00:26:55.700 --> 00:26:57.180
And this is most important.

00:26:57.180 --> 00:26:59.300
So everything starts
from the people,

00:26:59.300 --> 00:27:01.280
from buy-in from other leaders.

00:27:01.280 --> 00:27:05.060
If you can build this, if you
can let other leaders, which

00:27:05.060 --> 00:27:08.360
are going by, OK, this guy, the
word of this guy makes sense.

00:27:08.360 --> 00:27:11.270
Probably if we invest in data
science, we can achieve this,

00:27:11.270 --> 00:27:13.850
and this, this for
the business, is

00:27:13.850 --> 00:27:16.190
highly valuable for
the business itself,

00:27:16.190 --> 00:27:21.110
and the company will
eventually rise on this.

00:27:21.110 --> 00:27:25.340
And another thing is that
to help, if the person just

00:27:25.340 --> 00:27:27.800
wanted to say, I'm a
scientist, I want to grow up

00:27:27.800 --> 00:27:30.283
to a leadership
position, how could I

00:27:30.283 --> 00:27:32.450
persuade the company--
convince the company that I'm

00:27:32.450 --> 00:27:33.560
the right person?

00:27:33.560 --> 00:27:37.890
And I would say that besides
good results, of course,

00:27:37.890 --> 00:27:39.830
you also need to make
sure to show them

00:27:39.830 --> 00:27:43.380
that you can always do a good
job whenever they need it.

00:27:43.380 --> 00:27:45.350
And the other thing is
that you need to show

00:27:45.350 --> 00:27:46.820
the ambition to the leadership.

00:27:46.820 --> 00:27:50.570
This is my takeaway, that
is that especially right now

00:27:50.570 --> 00:27:53.280
that the job market for
data science is hard.

00:27:53.280 --> 00:27:56.120
So this is the right time
for you to show the company,

00:27:56.120 --> 00:27:58.770
I want to invest on my own self.

00:27:58.770 --> 00:28:01.950
I'm not just want to be a data
science doing coding, building

00:28:01.950 --> 00:28:02.450
