00:28:02.450 --> 00:28:05.480
I want to enlarge my influence.

00:28:05.480 --> 00:28:08.280
I want to learn more things
about the whole business.

00:28:08.280 --> 00:28:09.950
I want to move up.

00:28:09.950 --> 00:28:13.430
I want to be a leader
of a large organization.

00:28:13.430 --> 00:28:16.760
And usually, when you do
that, the company will realize

00:28:16.760 --> 00:28:18.410
your ambition, will
realize your value,

00:28:18.410 --> 00:28:21.860
and usually it will
generate good results,

00:28:21.860 --> 00:28:24.090
good feedback from the leaders.

00:28:24.090 --> 00:28:26.100
And actually, this
