00:58:55.120 --> 00:58:56.440
It's not very predictive.

00:58:56.440 --> 00:58:58.960
It adds a little bit predictive
power on top of everything

00:58:58.960 --> 00:58:59.890
we have right now.

00:58:59.890 --> 00:59:03.890
But it's kind of challenging to
