00:59:03.890 --> 00:59:05.450
into our decision process.

00:59:05.450 --> 00:59:08.560
And the other thing is that
because of our industry,

00:59:08.560 --> 00:59:09.650
we are software industry.

00:59:09.650 --> 00:59:13.870
So a lot of our customers
they are contractors.

00:59:13.870 --> 00:59:17.590
Maybe they work in
