00:59:22.570 --> 00:59:24.460
But the impact is not that much.

00:59:24.460 --> 00:59:26.020
So again, not just inflation.

00:59:26.020 --> 00:59:28.810
Right now the tech
layoff, because all

00:59:28.810 --> 00:59:33.890
