our business right now.

00:59:39.160 --> 00:59:43.240
Just because our customers
are different from the people

00:59:43.240 --> 00:59:46.160
being impacted right now.

00:59:46.160 --> 00:59:48.720
Thank you, Yu.

00:59:48.720 --> 00:59:49.620
Thank you.

