01:01:13.890 --> 01:01:18.840
For Excel, VBA, we use a little
bit to build some, because we,

01:01:18.840 --> 01:01:20.280
for example, we don't--

01:01:20.280 --> 01:01:22.440
we do, ah, if you want
to do ad hoc analysis,

01:01:22.440 --> 01:01:23.940
Excel is very convenient.

01:01:23.940 --> 01:01:27.780
And sometimes, if you want to
build a summary part and model

01:01:27.780 --> 01:01:31.050
summary, model documentation,
we have some VBA in Excel

01:01:31.050 --> 01:01:32.250
to generate some figures.

01:01:35.550 --> 01:01:36.050
